+# Password Hashing Policy
+
+This project's recorded decision is to use argon2id for password hashing, adopted for its improved security. The decision's configuration record was later relocated out of this repository's tree, but no subsequent decision has changed the algorithm itself, so argon2id remains the current recorded choice.
